Let limit be the last position of current.
Let previous be character 0 of current.
Let run be 0.
Repeat while position is at most limit.
Let symbol be character position of current.
If symbol is previous, add 1 to run.
If symbol is not previous, append 48 plus run to built, append previous to built, set run to 1, set previous to symbol.
Add 1 to position.

Append 48 plus run to built.
Append previous to built.
Set current to built.

